# Copy to egress.env (chmod 600). Never commit it. Only the egress witness and the agent load it; the gateway does not,
# so the gateway cannot connect through the witness as an agent. One line per agent in config/egress.json, named by
# that agent's secretEnv. Make a secret with: openssl rand -hex 32 (hex: the agent's proxy URL carries it as written).
EGRESS_SECRET_RESEARCH_AGENT=
